WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.470
Each physical property of sound has a quality we perceive. Amplitude is heard as loudness: more amplitude, louder sound.

2
00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:19.476
Frequency is heard as pitch. The more cycles per second, the higher the sound. The period, the time of one cycle, is its inverse.

3
00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:28.085
Duration is how long the sound lasts. An envelope decides when it starts and when it ends.

4
00:00:31.135 --> 00:00:40.508
Timbre is the color of the sound. Two sounds with the same pitch sound different if their harmonics differ: it shows in the waveform and, above all, in the spectrum.
